# The client's untouched camera originals (~52 MB). Kept on disk as the master
# copies but never committed: the optimised WebP derivatives in public/images
# are what the site actually serves, and git is a poor home for binaries this
# size. Archive these alongside the handover, not in the repository.
/media-originals
